cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use koine, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "koine: Synthesised Fourth Opinion for Bayesian Triangulation"
version: 0.3.0
abstract: >-
  Synthesises one coherent, independent predictive opinion for a Bayesian model
  from a curated battery of known and underutilised inference methods, or
  abstains when no diversity gain exists. It stacks over model-structure and
  method diversity in predictive space (leave-one-out stacking, PSIS-gated) on an
  axis orthogonal to the engine axis, to serve as a fourth, synthesised witness
  alongside an independent panel of inference engines.
authors:
